      "finding": "Cindercaller4920 moves through many current disclosed cells, changes facing, receives actual damage and emits a genuine cast, while every recorded static row retains the same cindercaller atlas rect0,0,16,24. The body lacks walk, hurt and distinct cast derivatives in this baseline. Preserve this accepted identity and make its real actions legible."
