    },
    {
      "severity": "actual event",
      "finding": "The final sequence contains actual3-damage Lunge to caster4920 (12\u21929HP), actual3-damage cast result to magpie4884 (6\u21923HP per root/source and hit receipt), and actual Pyromancy_EmberSpit callback duration0.24 at tick1630. Source67,20 and target65,20 were both disclosed; sampling was armed by this genuine callback."
    },
    {
      "severity": "precision correction",
      "finding": "Lunge source69,18\u2192target67,20 denotes reach targeting, not player displacement. All final frame receipts and the saved post-cast prefix retain player69,18 with30HP."
    },
    {
      "severity": "readability",
